				\begin{document}$$\left( {x_r > \tilde x \wedge y_r > \tilde y} \right) \vee (x_r \le \tilde x \wedge y_r \le \tilde y)$$\end{document}xr>x~∧yr>y~∨(xr≤x~∧yr≤y~)was termed the fraction of concordant reads. To generate unphased, random control measurements, the average per read of the second CGI was randomly shuffled 100 times and each time the fraction of concordant reads was calculated. The average across all random samplings was reported per CGI pair.
